        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakaamba makani aamisamu, nkukuti misamu yoonse kuzwa kukedari uumena mucilundu ca-Lebano akusikila kumusampwiza uumena abulambo. Amakani aabanyama abayuni atuuka answi, oonse buyo wakalaabwene. ",
